== questions ==
I asked every question I could.
Fogg answered none of them.
* Press harder
    He finally turned to me.
    The look was enough.
    We rode on in silence.
* Fall silent
    We rode on in silence.

== silent ==
... but I said nothing and we passed the day in silence.

== quiet ==
